Camp Fire Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Camp Fire
    Actions
        Unit Group - Remove (Triggering unit) from CampFireGroup.
        Custom script:   call RemoveCampfire(GetTriggerUnit())
        -------- Remove Light unit related to the dying camp fire --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units within 50.00 of CampFirePoint.) and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Light
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Remove (Picked unit) from the game
                    Else - Actions
        -------- If all camp fires ended --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in CampFireGroup) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                -------- Turn OffTriggers --------
            Else - Actions
